Why an exception to the repository's CC0: because this document is signed.
Attribution here is not a matter of style but the very meaning of the object — a
defensive publication establishes dated and attributed prior art, and its authors
have consented by name to sign it.

The rest of the repository is dedicated to the public domain. See `LICENSE` at the
root.

Spread it widely: that is the point. Prior art blocks only what it publicly
discloses.
